SUMMARY:An Evening with Dan Signor
DESCRIPTION:Dan Signor is a seasoned musician with a career spanning over two decades. Dan‘s musical journey has taken him overseas\, where he has shared the stage and his soul-infused melodies with fans around the world. Known as the modern-day piano man\, Dan Signor’s solo performances are a unique blend of rock\, incorporating not only his masterful piano skills but also his soulful\, raspy vocals\, acoustic guitar\, and his signature percussive kick drum. Influenced by legends like Ray Charles and contemporary rock icons like Kings of Leon\, Dan‘s music resonates with a raw and raspy voice that adds depth and emotion to his performances. Dan‘s repertoire includes a mix of original compositions and crowd-pleasing cover tunes\, ensuring that every audience member is engaged and entertained. \nThe Crowbar – Asheville’s Best Flockin’ Bar 🐦‍⬛Live Music Every Thursday & Saturday 🎶Sun – Thurs | 1pm to 1amFri – Sat | 1pm to 2am \nDrinks\, Snacks\, Games\, Live Music\, DJ’s\, Karaoke\, More
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/an-evening-with-dan-signor-2/
LOCATION:Crowbar Asheville\, 92 Patton Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_5805-e1783133812129.jpeg
GEO:35.5941004;-82.5553361
